            "paragraph": "In Europe, recent heatwaves and prolonged dryness have indicated a substantial increase in the probability of catastrophic fires under moderate warming, especially in southern, central and northern regions, with rising susceptibility (Ber\u010d\u00e1k et al. 2024; Knutzen et al. 2023).",
